# Docker does not require this file. BuildKit loads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# from the context when the file is present, and this one is present because
# it lives under chaos/box/ and is therefore on the fingerprint file list.
# The context is already exactly that list (path, bytes, executable bit),
# staged by chaos/src/host/build.ts. Patterns here would be a second filter
# and could drop a listed file. This file matches nothing.
# Do not add patterns.
